<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX index ends at record high.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX index ends at record high.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's BUX index finished officially at a third successive record closing high of 7,149.03 points, up 154.73.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 7.832 billion forints, compared to 5.878 billion on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
